{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17384","headline":"国子柳博士兼领太常博士辄申贺赠 · 权德舆","name":"国子柳博士兼领太常博士辄申贺赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"博士本秦官，求才帖职难。\n临风曲台净，对月璧池寒。\n讲学分阴重，斋祠晓漏残。\n朝衣辨色处，双绶更宜看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}